303.4833bT777i  a303.4833bT777i1 aTraub, Charles H97572210aIn the realm of the circuit :bcomputers, art, and culture /cCharles H. Traub, Jonathan Lipkin  aUpper Saddle River, N.J. :bPearson Prentice Hall,cc2004  axiii, 433 p. :bill. (certaines en coul.) ;c26 cm  aGlossaire: p. 404-413  aIndex: p. 423-433  aNotes (part. bibliogr.): p.391-392  aBibliogr.: p.414-419  aFor undergraduate/graduate courses in Computer Art, History of Graphic Design and any new media course that deals with creativity and technology.

Richly illustrated and focusing broadly on the history and development of creative applications of technology, In the Realm of the Circuit is a primer for designers, artists, and humanists. The book draws on diverse and multi-cultural examples from ancient civilizations to the present to illustrate the roots of all forms of creative expression, and their evolution through digital technology. It demonstrates the connection between the arts, humanities and technology that continue to influence today's digital society. [Amazon] 6aOrdinateurs et civilisation922611 6975725aArt par ordinateur1 975726aLipkin, Jonathan  cLIVRE2ddc01198nam?a2200301 a?450000100090000000300060000900500170001500800410003202000150007304000150008804100080010304400070011108200160011809200160013424501600015026000490031030000290035944000300038850400250041852001960044365000310063965500300067070000260070090100210072694200150074795201170076299900170087943116039CaQJC20240213085743.0080311s2006    fr ||||| |||| 00| 0 fre d  a2749205875  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  afr0 a155.4bV656  a155.4bV65613aLa vie de l'enfant :bce que vous avez toujours voulu savoir sans jamais oser le demander /csous la direction de Michel Soulé ; préface de Rémy Puyuelo  aRamonville-Saint-Agne :béd. Érès,c2006.  a278 p. :bill. ;c22 cm. 0aLa vie de l'enfant965911  aBibliogr. p. 271-276  aDes réponses sur les interrogations relatives aux représentations et parfois aux difficultés pour l'enfant à définir la place des différentes personnes de son groupe familial. [Memento] 6aEnfantsxPsychologie93657 6aActes de congrès93000021 aSoulé, Michel975773  bAmélie Gauthier  cLIVRE2ddc  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2008-03-11l0o155.4 V656p001774343r2023-05-31 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c40097d4009701211nam a2200361 i 38176109CaQJC20150416105145.0mt|                     981117s1996    be ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre d       a2894510950  a(CaQMCD)9614982  aCaQMCDbf