28110825.0mt|040119s2003    fr ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre c  a284670063X  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  afr0 a364.106bC924m  a364.106bC924m1 aCretin, Thierry98926913aLa mafia /cThierry Cretin  aParis :bLe Cavalier bleu,cc2003.  a124 p. ;c18 cm0 9310425aIdées reçuesv57  aBibliogr. : p. 123-124  aFilmographie: p. 121-122  aA l'heure de la mondialisation, les mafias ont tiré profit de profondes mutations à l'échelle internationale, renforçant les craintes et les fantasmes à leur égard. L'auteur, procureur de la République adjoint à Lyon depuis 1993, conseiller à l'Office européen de lutte antifraude de la Commission européenne, explique avec rigueur le fonctionnement de ces organisations criminelles. [Memento]  6aMafiazItaliezSicile989270 6aMafiazRussie989271 6aMafiazJapon989272 6aCrime organisé917701 6929121aMafia  bAmélie Gauthier  cLIVRE2ddc  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-05-05l7o364.106 C924mp001819591r2024-05-22 08:31:01s2016-03-11w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c49927d4992701839nam a2200325 i 26aSoccer9392166  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l1o796.3342 U58sp001685586r2024-07-24 00:00:00s2017-09-06w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c50035d5003538274112CaQJC20240415091437.0mt|                     020916s2000    xxuŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ eng c       a0764552295  aCaQJCbfre0 aeng  axxu0 a796.3342bU58s0 a796.3342bU58s2 aUnited States Soccer Federation98939310aSoccer for dummies /cby United States Soccer Federation and Michael Lewis ; foreword by Alexi Lalas  aSan Mateo, Calif. :bIDG Books,c2000.  axxx, 372 p. :bill. ;c24 cm  aIndex: p. 357-372  aGlossaire: p. 335-346  aPacked with advice and tips for players and fans alike. From the explosion of youth and adult leagues to the growing fan base for men's and women's professional teams and World Cup competition, soccer - the world's most popular sport - has hit the big time in the U.S. Brimming with tips and techniques, official rules and regulations, coaching advice, and much more, this the guide American soccer aficionados have been waiting for. Illustrations, photos, and in-depth instruction for each position on the field Tips on passing, dribbling, headers, goaltending, scoring, and more Winning advice from top coaches and players Explanations of soccer rules, terms, and coverage of its history, and traditions How to watch the game and understand what's happening on - and off - the field  [Memento]1 aLewis, Michael989395  cLIVRE2ddc  bJean-Christophe Desrosiers01319nam a2200325 i   00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l0o519.72 M527pp001738787r2024-06-17 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c50071d5007138294721CaQJC20180621091024.0mt|                     040517s2004    fr ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre c       a2710808447  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  afr0 a519.72bM527p0 a519.72bM527p1 aMellouli, Khaled98943710aProgrammation linéaire et applications :béléments de cours et exercices résolus /cKhaled Mellouli, Abdelkader El Kamel, Pierre Borne  aParis :bTechnip,c2004.  avi, 112 p. :bill. ;c23 cm0 aSciences et technologies,x1243-0226 ;v16989438  aApproche de la programmation linéaire illustrée d'exemples et d'exercices appliquée à l'allocation et à l'optimisation des ressources concernant la finance, l'économie et la production. [Memento] 6932529aProgrammation linéaire 6989439aProgrammation linéairevProblèmes et exercices1 aBorne, Pierre9894401 aEl Kamel, Abdelkader989441  cLIVRE2ddc01112nam a2200313 i 4500952014300000999001700143001000900160003000600169005001700175006000200192007002400194008005900218020001500277040001500292041000800307044000700315082001900322100003200341245006600373260003500439300001900474440004100493500001400534505011000548650005900658700002900717901003700746942001500783  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.RLEEd2005-07-03g8.95l1m2o863.64 F363dvp001596868r2024-06-14 00:00:00s2022-02-09w