This book provides the basic principles of turfgrass managment at a level that is accessible to students but which is also suitable for experienced professionals. Today in the US turfgrass is a $50 billion industry.
* Covers basic turfgrass science, fertilisation, mowing and turfgrass diseases and also provides practice tools to enable the reader to make practical every day management decisions
* This new edition offers expanded information on turfgrass nutrition, nitrogen sources, weeds, insects and disease identification and management
* Colour photos of grasses, weeds and turfgrass diseases makes this an easy-to-use valuable resource for students [AbeBooks] 6aPelousesxEntretien916073 6aPelouses916071  cLIVRE2ddc01392nam a2200385 i 38208585CaQJC20241119154211.0mt|                     991011s1998    qucŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre c       a2894481284  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  aquc0 a971.40072bA1110 a971.40072bA11100aÀ propos de l'histoire nationale /csous la dir. de Robert Comeau et Bernard Dionne  aSillery :bSeptentrion,c1998.  a160 p. ;c23 cm.  a"Cet ouvrage collectif est le fruit d'un colloque organisé en 1998 par l'Association québécoise d'histoire politique (AQHP)..."--Couv.  aNotes (part. bibliogr.) au bas des p.  aBibliogr. : p. 143-157.26aNationalismezQuébec (Province)9795 6aCanadaxHistoriographie9104318 4aQuébec (Province)xHistoriographie92286312 aAssociation québécoise d'histoire politique99530 9115505aDionne, Bernard,d1951-0 9115811aComeau, Robert,d1945-  mL  cLIVRE  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l1o971.40072 A111p001628885r2025-01-14 00:00:00s2018-08-29w2011-03-26yLIVRE  a3  c94013d94013  bAndréanne Sauvé01083nam a2200289 i 4500952013900000999001700139001000900156003000600165005001700171006000200188007002400190008005900214020001500273040001500288041000800303044000700311082001800318100003500336245005400371260003500425300002700460440003900487520015600526650005900682901003700741942001500778  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.RLEEd2005-07-03g8.95l1o863.64 S685mp001601477r2024-06-14 00:00:00s2013-04-18w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c94021d9402138194677CaQJC20210317112026.0mt|                     990416s1995    sp ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ spa c       a8487099823  aCaQJCbfre0 aspa  asp0 a863.64bS685m1 aSoler-Espiauba, Dolores91641010aMás se perdió en Cuba /cDolores Soler-Espiauba  aBarcelona :bDifusion,cc1995.  a47 p. :bill. ;c19 cm0 aVenga a leer. Hotel Veramar916411  