 /cSébastien St-Onge  aQuébec :bNota bene,cc2001.  a177 p. :bill. ;c19 cm0 aInterventions9146372  aNotes (part. bibliogr.) au bas des p.  aBibliogr.: p. 167-174 6aPompes funèbreszQuébec (Province)9146373 6aEntrepreneurs de pompes funèbreszQuébec (Province)9146374 6aFunéraillesxRites et cérémonieszQuébec (Province)911536 6aMortxAspect religieux980687 6aMortxIndustriezQuébec (Province)9146375  mL  cLIVRE  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l0o338.47614609714 S148ip001635361r2023-07-26 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  a3  c100951d10095101674naa a2200289ua 4500952012000000999001900120001000900139003000600148005001700154008004100171020001500212040001500227041000800242044000800250082001900258092001900277100003000296245005700326260004600383300003800429500002200467520079100489650002801280650004101308650002001349942001501369  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2007-02-19l0o635.9676 K55np001758907r2024-07-18 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c100963d10096342799677CaQJC20180905155323.0070219s||||||||xxu||||?|||||||||?|?eng||  a0881925640  aCaQJCbfre0 aeng  axxu0 a635.9676bK55n  a635.9676bK55n1 aKingsbury, Noël,910145310aNatural gardening in small spaces /cNoël Kingsbury  aPortland, Oregon :bTimber Press,cc2003.  a176 p. :bill. en coul. ;c28 cm.  aIndex: p. 174-175  aWith the growing recognition that a wisely and sensitively planted garden has a lot to offer to wildlife and the food web, more and more people are looking for ways to make their gardens environmentally friendly. However, gardeners have tended to assume that they need a lot of space to create habitats for wildlife and to evoke wild and natural places. In Natural Gardening in Small Spaces, renowned plantsman Noël Kingsbury refutes that presumption, showing how even in a small garden you can create a sustainable ecosystem that looks great --- and, once established, largely looks after itself. More than 150 glorious photographs of small natural gardens provide visual confirmation of Noël Kingsbury's contention that even the smallest garden can provide a natural haven. [Amazon] 6aJardins naturels916765 6aAménagement paysager naturel916767 69115713aJardins  cLIVRE2ddc01278nam a2200313 a 4500952013500000999001900135001000900154003000600163005001700169008004100186020001500227040001800242082001900260092001900279245017200298260003800470300002900508500001100537500002300548504002900571520016100600534004700761650002200808650003400830650003200864700003000896710002300926942001500949  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2010-08-27l10m2o616.8527 D424p01935386r2024-06-20 00:00:00s2019-09-13w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c101001d10100143700199CaQJC20180905155317.0100827s2006????quc|||||||||||||| ||fre|d  a2890007588  aCaQSTEJCbfre0 a616.8527bD424  a616.8527bD42413aLa dépression /cClinique Mayo ; sous la direction de Keith Kramlinger ; révision scientifique de la version française, Brian G. Bexton ; traduction, Normand Lebeau  aSaint-Constant :bBroquet,c2006.  a216 p. :bill. ;c23 cm.  a19.95$  aIndex: p. 211-216.  aWebographie: p. 207-210.  aCe livre vous aidera à mieux comprendre la maladie, les facteurs psychologiques et biologiques associés et les formes de traitement disponibles. [Memento]  tTitre original: Mayo Clinic on depression. 6aDépression98211 6aDépressionxTraitement94304 69313118aTroubles bipolaires1 9146416aKramlinger, Keith2 aMayo Clinic954131  cLIVRE2ddc01077nam a2200349 i 38163847CaQJC20150417122725.0mt|                     971008s1996    fr ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre c       a2070533549  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  afr0 a540.112bA769a0 a540.112bA769a1 aAromatico, Andrea914642510aAlchimie :ble grand secret /cAndrea Aromatico ; trad. de l'italien par Audrey van de Sandt  aParis :bGallimard,cc1996.  a144 p. :bill. (certaines en coul.) ;c18 cm0 aDécouvertes ;v30293940 aTraditions