-201710aCésar imperator /cMax Gallo  aParis :bXO,cc2003.  a452 p. :bcarte ;c24 cm  aLe destin exceptionnel de Jules César retracé grâce à de surprenantes et authentiques révélations. Connu pour ses campagnes militaires, son oeuvre littéraire et ses amours, ce grand homme de l'histoire est présenté au travers de sa propre construction, mélange d'ambition, de doutes et de cruauté. [Memento]16aCésar, Jules9394678 6942866aEmpereurszRomevBiographies 6aRomexHistoirey265-30 av. J.-C. (République)93825  2ddccLIVRE  bAmélie Gauthier00938nam a2200313 i 450000100090000000300060000900500170001500600020003200700240003400800590005802000150011704000160013204100080014804400070015608200190016309200190018210000360020124500450023725000120028226000280029430000210032244000350034350000230037850400270040165000300042894200150045895201320047399900190060538285869CaQJC20150417160058.0mt|                     031009s2002    fr ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre d       a2100063677  aCaQMCDbfre0 afre  afr0 a658.835bC373e0 a658.835bC373e1 aCaumont, Daniel,9218761d1946-14aLes études de marché /cDaniel Caumont  a2e éd.  aParis :bDunod,cc2002.  a128 p. ;c18 cm.0 aLes topos. Éco/Gestion949767  aIndex: p. 127-128.  aBibliogr.: p. 123-126. 6aÉtudes de marché.97203  2ddccLIVRE  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l1o658.835 C373ep001729194r2024-07-19 00:00:00s2014-09-12w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c134187d13418701387nam a2200289 a 4500952011900000999001900119001000900138003000600147005001700153008004100170020001500211040001700226041000800243044000700251082001800258092001800276100003600294245012600330260003000456300004000486504002600526520042200552534006200974650002501036942001501061901002101076  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2006-01-04l0o853.914 E19mp001763334r2024-08-09 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c134211d13421142417605CaQJC20230313101659.0051028s2005????fr a???|||??? 000 f fre#c  a2246670810  b