rrit cette "polyphonie magistralement orchestrée par une conteuse" experte: dictons, proverbes, expressions dialectales, fragments de légendes, commentaires et réparties. Elle en a de la mémoire collective, cette Antonine Maillet... 6aRomans québécois93897930 a100 ans dans les bois.  2ddccLIVRE  00102ddc4070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l0o843.54 M2212cep001662318r2024-08-08 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c146989d146989  bAmélie Gauthier01105nam a2200313 i 450000100090000000300060000900500170001500800540003202000150008604000150010104100080011604400080012408200190013209200190015110000360017024501230020626000690032930000270039850000250042550400250045065000410047565000310051670000340054771000380058194200100061995201370062998000060076699900190077238284167CaQJC20150417170848.0990505s1998    quc****ŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0Œ* Œ fre c       a2891301722  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  aquc0 a664.072bF742g0 a664.072bF742g0 aFortin, Jacinthe,d1951-99167510aGuide d'entraînement d'un jury de dégustation /cJacinthe Fortin et Catherine Desplancke ; préf. de Claude B. Aubé  aSaint-Hyacinthe :bFondation des gouverneurs :bÉdisem,cc1998.  axvii, 106 p. ;c23 cm.  aGlossaire: p. 85-89.  aBibliogr.: p. 79-83. 6aAlimentsxAnalyse sensorielle991677 6aAnalyse sensorielle9658531 aDesplancke, Catherine91888172 aFondation des gouverneurs9104157  cLIVRE  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l17m15o664.072 F742gp001723237r2025-04-28 08:28:28s2025-01-31w2011-03-26yLIVRE  a3  c146993d14699300714nam a2200289 i 450000100090000000300060000900500170001500600020003200700240003400800600005802000150011804000150013304100080014804400080015608200180016409200180018210000370020024500390023726000420027630000210031850000190033965000250035891200060038394200100038998000060039999900190040538145955CaQJC20150819010048.0mt|                     940811s1993    qucŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre Œ       a2890515117  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  aquc