F911a0 a940.5318bF911a0 aFriedländer, Saul,d1932-913198112aL'Allemagne nazie et les Juifs /cSaul Friedländer ; trad. de l'anglais par Marie-France de Paloméra  aParis :bÉditions du Seuil,cc1997-  av. ;c24 cm0 aXXe siècle913648  aComprend un index  aComprend une bibliogr.8 aDépouillement : Vol. 1. Les années de persécution, 1933-1939  aUne synthèse sur ce processus criminel que fut l'élimination des juifs dans l'Allemagne nazie. Nourri de documents souvents inédits, des témoignages des bourreaux, des victimes ou de simples individus sans thèse polémique ni passion déplacée, cet ouvrage veut donner une dimension humaine à ce qui n'est trop souvent qu'un constat glacé. [Memento]  pTitre original :tNazi Germany and the Jews 6aJuifszAllemagnexHistoirey1933-19459189159 6aJuifsxPersécutionszAllemagne9189161 6aHolocauste, 1939-1945d1939-1945953389 6aAllemagnexPolitique et gouvernementy1933-1945920925 6aAllemagnexRelations interethniques9605404 aLes années de persécution, 1933-1939  bAmélie Gauthier  cLIVRE2ddc  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l7m1o940.5318 F911ap001738240r2025-01-09 00:00:00s2019-10-21w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c147363d14736301959nam a2200433 i   00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03edepartementTESg25.00l10m8o362.2909714 U84p002137065r2023-08-02 00:00:00s2022-09-30w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c147407d14740738228806CaQJC20231026084858.0mt|                     020626s2001    qucŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre c       a2892181291  aCaQJCbfre0 afre  aquc0 a362.2909714bU840 a362.2909714bU8400aUsage et abus de drogues :bguide d'accompagnement et d'intervention /cconçu et rédigé par Lise Durocher ... et al  aMontréal :bCentres jeunesse de Montréal :bRégie régionale de la santé et des services sociaux de Montréal-Centre, Direction régionale de la santé publique :bCentre Dollard-Cormier,cc2001.  a114 p. :bill. ;c28 cm0 aIntervention et services9189193  a"Lexique": p. 101-105  aBibliogr.: p. 106-113 6aJeunessexUsage des drogueszQuébec (Province)939464 6aToxicomanie92685 6aCounselingxToxicomanie997939 6aJeunes difficilesxUsage des drogueszQuébec (Province)9189194 6aToxicomaniexRéadaptationzQuébec (Province)9189195 6921867aToxicomaniexPrévention 6942677aJeunessexUsage des drogues0 aDurocher, Lise,d1951-91891972 aCentres Jeunesse de Montréal9267792 aRégie régionale de la santé et des services sociaux de Montréal-Centre (Québec).bDirection de la santé publique91891992 aCentre Dollard-Cormier963003  uhttp://biblio.cegep-lanaudiere.qc.ca/table_des_matieres/tes/usage_abus.pdfyTable des matières  2ddccLIVRE  bAmélie Gauthier02646cam#a2200313uu#4500952012200000999001900122001000900141003000600150005001700156008004100173020001500214020001800229040001500247041000800262044000800270082002100278092002100299245007700320260004200397300003300439504004700472520163100519650003802150650004002188650004002228650002102268700002802289942001502317  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2007-06-04l0o615.14076 C529sp001797422r2024-06-20 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c147425d14742542898502CaQJC20180807150021.0070604s||||||||enk||||?|||||||||?|?eng||  a0470861231  a9780470861233  aCaQJCbfre0 aeng  aenk0 a615.14076bC529s  a615.14076bC529s10aStatistical methods for dose-finding experiments /cedited by S. Chevret  aEngland :bJohn Wiley & Sons,cc2006.  axv, 315 p. :bill. ;c24 cm.  aComprend des bibliogr. à la fin des chap.  aDose-finding experiments define the safe dosage of a drug in development, in terms of the quantity given to a patient. Statistical methods play a crucial role in identifying optimal dosage. Used appropriately, these methods provide reliable results and reduce trial duration and costs. In practice, however, dose-finding is often done poorly, with widely used conventional methods frequently being unreliable, leading to inaccurate results. However, there have been many advances in recent years, with new statistical techniques being developed and it is important that these new techniques are utilized correctly. Statistical Methods for Dose-Finding Experiments reviews the main statistical approaches for dose-finding in phase I/II clinical trials and presents practical guidance on their correct use.

    Includes an introductory section, summarizing the essential concepts in dose-finding.
    Contains a section on algorithm-based approaches, such as the traditional 3+3 design, and a section on model-based approaches, such as the continual reassessment method.
    Explains fundamental issues, such as how to stop trials early and how to cope with delayed or ordinal outcomes.
    Discusses in detail the main websites and software used to implement the methods.
    Features numerous worked examples making use of real data.

Statistical Methods for Dose-Finding Experiments is an important collaboration from the leading experts in the area. Primarily aimed at statisticians and clinicians working in clinical trials and medical research, there is also much to benefit graduate students of biostatistics. [AbeBooks] 6aGénétiquexStatistiques9189208 6aArithmétique pharmaceutique992673 6aMédicamentsxAdministration992675 6aPosologie9926791 aChevret, Sylvie9189209  cLIVRE2ddc00996nam a2200313 i 450000100090000000300060000900500170001500600020003200700240003400800590005802000150011704000160013204100080014804400070015608200140016309200140017724501170019125000410030826000430034930000250039250400480041765000210046570000280048691200060051494200100052095201270053098000060065799900190066338278189CaQJC20150417171023.0mt|                     030303s2002    fr ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre d       a2716312168  aCaQMCDbfre0 afre  afr0 a200bG9460 a200bG94603aLe guide des religions :bhistoire et vie des grandes religions du monde /ccollab. de René Berthier... [et al]  aNouv. éd. ent. ref. et actualisée.  aParis :bÉditions du Dauphin,cc2002.  a336, 15 p. ;c24 cm.  aBibliogr. à la fin de la plupart des chap. 6aReligions.938931 aBerthier, René9189211  mL  cLIVRE  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l2o200 G946p001695696r2023-07-13 00:00:00s2015-04-07w2011-03-26yLIVRE  a3  c147429d14742901088nam a2200301 i 4500952012000000999001900120001000900139003000600148005001700154006000200171007002400173008005900197020001500256022001400271040001500285041000800300044000700308082001900315092001900334100002800353245003700381260003100418300002800449440003000477520023900507650002500746942001500771  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2005-07-03l0o616.716 G353op001744835r2024-06-20 00:00:00w2011-03-26yLIVRE  c147453d14745338295031CaQJC20180719115009.0mt|                     040628s2004    fr ŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒŒ 0ŒŒ Œ fre c       a27381