geng0 a791.43750952bT531t00aThree filmsh[enregistrement vidéo] / cby Hiroshi Teshigahara3 aPitfall, Woman in the dunes, The face of another  aNew York :bCriterion Collection,cc2007.  a4 DVD (521 min) :bson., n&b et coul. ;c12 cm +e1 livret d'accompagnement (61 p.)0 aCriterion collectionv; 392/395  aCompilation regroupant trois films réalisés par Hiroshi Teshigahara.  aProductions originales japonaises réalisées de 1962 à 1966.0 aDVD.1. Pitfall (Otoshiana) (1962) -- DVD.2. Woman in the dunes (Suna no onna) (1964) -- DVD.3.  The face of another (Tanin no kao) (1966) -- DVD.4. The supplements to Three films by Hiroshi Teshigahara.1 aPitfall: Hisashi Igawa, Kunie Tanaka, Hideo Kanze.1 aWoman in the dunes: Eiji Okada, Kyoko Kishida.1 aThe face of another: Tatsuya Nakadai, Machiko Kyo, Mikijiro Hira.  aOne of the most acclaimed Japanese directors of all time, Hiroshi Teshigahara distinguished himself in the sixties with a series of sinuous, atmospheric, and daring films. Teshigahara found his spiritual partner in novelist and screenwriter Kobo Abe, with whom he collaborated on these Kafkaesque portraits of identities in peril, films that captivated mainstream audiences while also touching the edges of the Japanese avant-garde. The existential ghost story Pitfall (Otoshiana), the shocking, erotic fable Woman in the Dunes (Sunna no onna), and the sci-fi–tinged nightmare The Face of Another (Tanin no kao) are among cinema’s enduring enigmas and rarest pleasures. [Criterion]  aVersion plein écran.  aVersion originale japonaise, sous-titres en anglais. 6aDrames (Films)9169681 0aFilms asiatiques93402221 aTeshigahara, Hiroshi,d1927-2001eréalisateur.1 aIgawa, Hisashi,d1936-91962401 aOkada, Eiji,d1920-91962411 aNakadai, Tatsuya,d1932-91962422 aCriterion (Firme)939833 0aCriterion collection939823  cDVD2ddc  bCRON CRON00995nam a2200301 i 450000100090000000300060000900500170001500600020003200800430003402000150