  a9782914874670 (erroné)  aTraduction françaises par les éditions d'Héligoland, en 2010.  aBibliographie page 261.  aL'ouvrage est divisé en trois parties distinctes : création et conservation du monde, récit des exploits et de la vie des dieux, Ragnarok et régénération. Il met en lumière la dimension poétique et la sagesse des mythes du Nord. 6aMythologie nordique934893 6aEddas 9204966 0aEddas xHistoire et critique93441191 aLeclercq, Jules d1848-1928etraducteur93441171 aBagnuls, Pierre epréfacier9344118  aAL (2019-12-16)  cLIVRE01495cam a22002654a 4500001001000000003000600010005001700016008004100033020001800074040002000092082001700112100002900129245004300158250001200201260004500213300003500258500007100293500002300364520059600387650003400983942001501017952015601032999001901188901002201207002611034CaQJC20240129132407.0070327s2007    caua          001 0 eng    a9781449387860  aUKMdCaQJCbfre04a004.6bD674n1 aDonahue, Gary A.919887710aNetwork warrior /cby Gary A. Donahue.  a2nd ed.  aSebastopol, CA :bO'Reilly Media,c2011.  axxiii, 757 p. :bill ;c24 cm.  a"Everything you need to know that wasn't on the CCNA exam"--Cover.  aIndex: p. 731-757.  aPick up where certification exams leave off. With this practical, in-depth guide to the entire network infrastructure, you’ll learn how to deal with real Cisco networks, rather than the hypothetical situations presented on exams like the CCNA. Network Warrior takes you step by step through the world of routers, switches, firewalls, and other technologies based on the author's extensive field experience. You'll find new content for MPLS, IPv6, VoIP, and wireless in this completely revised second edition, along with examples of Cisco Nexus 5000 and 7000 switches throughout. [AbeBooks] 6914757aRéseaux d'ordinateurs  cLIVRE2ddc  00102ddc4070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2017-03-24g82.85l2m1o004.6 D674n ex.2p002162337r2023-05-30 00:00:00s2022-10-25tex.2