contains up-to-date advice on a range of topics including:
 
• Planning outstanding lessons
 • Teaching the four key language skills
• Stretching able and talented students
• Including and engaging students with weaker skills
• Using ICT to advance language skills and build international links
• Teaching modern languages at post 16
 
There is also a companion website containing links to useful resources and
websites. This book is invaluable for trainees, newly qualified teachers and
more experienced practitioners looking for practical ideas and strategies to
