Les aspects majeurs du marketing interentreprises. Les études de marché, la communication, la conception d'un produit, le choix du canal de distribution, la gestion des forces de vente, ainsi que la maintenance, la veille, les normes, le design, le marketing vert ou la formation au client sont traités. [Memento] 6aMarketing97199 6aMarketingvÉtudes de cas1 aBenaroya, Christophe  aAL (02-09-16)  cLIVRE2ddc02334nx  a22003251n   00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2016-09-16g81.27l4m4o155.2 H328cp002143414r2023-05-31 00:00:00s2017-05-02yLIVRE  c389098d389098030890303CaQJC20181212143836.0150827s2015    nyua     b    001 0 fre d  a9781462522729  aCaQHUbfreerdadCaQJC0 aeng  anyu0 a155.2bH328c1 aHarter, Susan,d1939-eauteur933750710aThe construction of the self :bdevelopmental and sociocultural foundations /cSusan Harter ; foreword by William M. Bukowski.  aSecond edition. 1aNew York :bThe Guilford Press,c[2015]  axxiii, 440 pages :billustrations ;c23 cm.  atextebtxt2rdacontent  asans médiationbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aComprend des références bibliographiques (pages 377-426) et un index.  aAn important work from a leading scholar, this book explores self-development from early childhood to adulthood. Susan Harter traces the normative stages that define the emergence of many self-processes, including self-esteem. She also addresses individual differences and societal influences on self-development. Presenting pioneering empirical research, Harter shows that increasingly mature features of the self have both benefits and liabilities for psychological adjustment. The book highlights the causes and consequences of different types of self-representations, including those that are unrealistically negative or positive. New to This Edition Reflects more than a decade of conceptual, empirical, and methodological advances. Provides a broader sociocultural framework for understanding self development. Chapters on emerging adulthood, self-esteem and physical appearance, self-processes in the classroom, motivation, cross-cultural issues, and the quest for authenticity. Expanded chapters on childhood, adolescence, and the self-conscious emotions. Increased attention to the liabilities of our contemporary preoccupation with the self.  [bokus.com] 6aMoi chez l'enfant9297424 6aMoi chez l'adolescent9297425  aAL (16-09-16)  cLIVRE01362nam a2200349 i 0005350000CaQJC20240422154620.0ta      s2016    quca     b    000 0 fre    a9782763728742  aQMBNbfreerdadCaQJC0 afre  aquc0 a307.1216bV74704aLes villes à la croisée des stratégies globales et locales des enjeux climatiques /csous la direction de Florence Rudolf 1a[Québec] :bPresses de l'Université Laval,c[2016]  aviii, 363 pages :billustrations ;c24 cm  atextebtxt2rdacontent  asans médiationbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aComprend des références bibliographiques. 6aUrbanismexFacteurs climatiques 6aUrbanismexAspect de l'environnement974131 6aClimatxChangementsxGestion du risque9247822 6aAdaptation aux changements climatiques92977861 aRudolf, Florenceeéditeur intellectuel9297503 0aSociologie contemporaine (Presses de l'Université Laval)9371169  aAL (07-09-16)bAmélie Gauthier  cLIVRE  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2016-09-07g45.74l0o307.1216 V747p002143082r2023-07-19 00:00:00yLIVRE  c389112d38911201444cam a2200301 a 4500952014500000999001900145001001100164003000600175005001700181007000300198008004100201020001800242040002700260041001300287044000700300082001800307100005400325245013500379260002900514300002100543520039800564650002000962650002600982650003901008830004401047901003601091942001501127  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2016-09-07g20.28l1o323.44 D261sp002143058r2023-08-22 00:00:00s2023-05-25v19.95w2016-09-07yLIVRE  c389113d3891130005228011CaQJC20240819163745.0ta160412s2016    be     g   