d formulas to those aspiring to be professional bakers and professional pastry chefs. It is the only available resource covering complex bread making, viennoiserie and pastry into one book. Exquisite photographs are throughout to further inspire learners and professionals of the unlimited potential of the craft. Advanced Bread and Pastry provides in depth information and troubleshooting strategies for addressing the complex techniques of the advanced level of bread and pastry arts. [AbeBooks] 6aPain957753 6aPâtisserie98221 6aProduits de pâtisserie9314302 6aCuisson au four982539  aAL (15-05-17)bJean-Christophe Desrosiers  cLIVRE2ddc  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2017-05-12g169.70l12m13o641.815 S939ap002165709r2024-11-25 16:21:57s2024-09-24v166.95w2017-05-12yLIVRE  c471141d47047800991nam a2200253 a 4500952013400000999001900134001001100153003000600164005001700170008004100187020001500228020001800243040002800261041000800289082001900297100002600316245010100342260005200443300003300495520013500528650004100663901001800704942001500722  00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2017-06-01g26.38l0o641.873 M911rp002166234r2024-07-18 00:00:00v25.95w2017-06-01yLIVRE  c471147d4704840002933884CaQJC20180720112721.0040213s2004    coua          001 0 eng    a0937381837  a9780937381830  aDLCcDLCdCaQTBCdCaQJC1 aeng0 a641.873bM911r1 aMosher, Randy931492610aRadical brewing :brecipes, tales, and world-altering meditations in a glass /cby Randy Mosher.  aBoulder, Colo. :bBrewers Publications,cc2004.  aix, 324 p. :bill. ;c23 cm.  aRadical Brewing takes a hip and creative look at beer brewing, presented with a graphically appealing two-color layout. [AbeBooks] 6aBrassagevManuels d'amateurs9178398  aAL (06-06-17)  cLIVRE2ddc01789cam a22003614a   00104070aCaQJCbCaQJCcLANAU.CGd2017-05-12g147.39l10m9o664 S416 2010p002165694r2024-07-19 00:00:00s2023-11-29v145.00w2017-05-12yLIVRE  c4